    "abstract": "Illustrated parts figure for the air starter motor installation, the starter duct clamp and the start valve hardware, showing the original and the compensating clamp standards.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure identifies the air starter motor mounting hardware, the starter duct clamp, the heat shield tab and the start valve items on the accessory gearbox pad.",
      "figure_note": "The figure is drawn for the left engine; the right engine is a mirror image with the same part numbers. The compensating clamp and the heat shield tab are supplied and installed together, and the original clamp must not be refitted where the tab is present because the band diameter differs at the tab position."
    },
